This tool writes Studio 5000 import files and project copies that end up running on industrial
equipment. That warranty disclaimer is not boilerplate: everything LogicControl writes is meant to
be imported, verified and reviewed in Studio 5000 by a qualified person before it goes near a
controller, and LogicControl itself never connects to one.

---

LogicControl reads and writes the L5X format as Studio 5000 exports it. It is not affiliated with,
endorsed by or derived from software of Rockwell Automation; Studio 5000 and Logix are trademarks of
their owners.

Third-party components are used under their own licences:

